#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ffill.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.ffill"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:1 of
msgid "Forward-fill: propagate the last non-null value forward."
msgstr "前向填充：向前传播最后一个非空值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:3 of
msgid ""
"Consecutive nulls are replaced with the most recent non-null value "
"observed earlier in the row order.  ``limit <= 0`` raises ``ValueError`` "
"(matching pandas)."
msgstr ""
"连续的空值被行顺序中较早观察到的最近非空值替换。``limit <= 0`` 会引发 ``"
"ValueError`` （与pandas一致）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:7 of
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive nulls to fill in each run."
msgstr "每次运行中要填充的最大连续空值数量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:9 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to fill.  If None, all visible columns are filled. Non-selected"
" columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要填充的列。如果为None，则填充所有可见列。未选择的列保持不变通过。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:13 of
msgid ""
"Forward-filled LiteFrame with the same shape and columns.  Output dtypes "
"equal the input dtypes (no widening, including decimal)."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状和列的前向填充LiteFrame。输出数据类型等于输入数据类型（不进行"
"扩展，包括十进制）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:19 of
msgid ":py:obj:`bfill`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:20 of
msgid "Backward-fill missing values."
msgstr "后向填充缺失值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:22 of
msgid ":py:obj:`fillna`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:23 of
msgid "Fill missing values."
msgstr "填充缺失值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.fill.ffill:26 of
